      "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Free City, a famous red-light district full of brothels with a variety of races attracts both locals and foreigners. Suddenly, due to the opening of a competing brothel that provides new and innovative sexual services, the old brothels find themselves nearly out of business. The new brothel is run by reincarnators and the red-light district must find a way to survive its competition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game info:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of the game is to unify all the brothels and manage a better business than the competing reincarnator's brothel with cheat-like otherworld knowledge. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are two difficulties:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual mode: There is no ongoing debt. You can outshine the competition eventually in a debt-free situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Normal mode: There is a monthly debt to be paid. The brothels are in danger of closing if the reincarnator's brothel continues to attract your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are three major elements to the game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-H Battle:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To gain the trust of various races, you must satisfy the head prostitute in each race's brothel. You can sign a cooperative contract after gaining the trust of the head prostitute. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Research:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can learn various otherworldly sexual services in the reincarnator's brothel. After learning from the competition, you can further enhance sexual services by taking advantage of your racial traits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Open for business:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The true essence of a brothel. Face your competition, learn the skills, and upgrade your techniques!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >General：(Mouse)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >．Left button：Decide</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >．Right button： Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-H Battle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >．Hold the left button: Begin gameplay actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >．Hold the right button: Speed up action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-50+ base HCG, 150+ CG</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
